      {
        "id": "your-engine-s-temperature-warning-system",
        "title": "Your engine's temperature warning system",
        "description": "The coolant warning light is your engine's temperature warning system. Unlike the red oil light (which means immediate danger), the coolant light can mean anything from a minor top-up to catastrophic overheating - depending on which light you see.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "In our 24,650 quote dataset, we identified four primary causes:"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h4",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Low coolant level - 50% of cases"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Simple top-up required. Cost: £5-£150."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h4",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Coolant leak - 30% of cases"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "External leak from hose, radiator, or water pump. Cost: £50-£700."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h4",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Thermostat failure - 12% of cases"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Stuck closed, causing overheating. Cost: £80-£300."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h4",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Head gasket failure - 8% of cases"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Coolant entering combustion chamber. Cost: £550-£2,000+."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The critical distinction:"
          },
          {
            "type": "cards",
            "cards": [
              {
                "title": "🔴 Red thermometer",
                "text": "Engine overheating STOP DRIVING IMMEDIATELY",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "🔴 Red thermometer Engine overheating STOP DRIVING IMMEDIATELY"
              },
              {
                "title": "🟡 Yellow/red waves",
                "text": "Low coolant level Check when cool, top up",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "🟡 Yellow/red waves Low coolant level Check when cool, top up"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Light types - what each one means"
          }
        ],
        "links": [],
        "source": {
          "sectionId": "your-engine-s-temperature-warning-system",
          "order": 1
        }
      },
