      {
        "id": "red-thermometer-stop-driving-immediately",
        "title": "⚠️ Red thermometer = stop driving immediately",
        "description": "If the red thermometer light comes on:",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Pull over safely - Find a safe location immediately",
              "Turn off engine - Do not wait. Turn off the key immediately",
              "Wait 30+ minutes - Do not open the bonnet. Coolant is pressurised",
              "Do not add coolant - Wait for the engine to cool completely",
              "Call for recovery - Do not drive"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Why this is critical:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "The red thermometer means the engine is overheating",
              "Overheating causes cylinder head warping, head gasket failure, and piston seizure",
              "Continuing to drive will destroy the engine"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Check when cool:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Never open the coolant reservoir when the engine is hot",
              "Pressurised coolant can spray out and cause severe burns",
              "Wait at least 30 minutes before checking"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "🟡 Yellow coolant light (waves) = Check when cool The yellow waves light means low coolant level. Check the level when the engine is cold. Top up to the correct level. Monitor for future loss (indicates a leak)."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Book Emergency Recovery + Diagnostic"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "What happens if you ignore it - detailed progression"
          }
        ],
        "links": [
          {
            "href": "/services/vehicle-recovery",
            "text": "Book Emergency Recovery + Diagnostic"
          }
        ],
        "source": {
          "sectionId": "red-thermometer-stop-driving-immediately",
          "order": 7
        }
